{"task":{"id":"syntax","spec":"Write synthesizable SystemVerilog for exactly one module named counter with ports input wire clk, input wire rst, output reg [3:0] count.
On each rising edge of clk, synchronously set count to 4'b0000 if rst is high; otherwise increment count by one modulo 16. No other behavior is required.
Return only the complete RTL source, without Markdown or explanation. Do not include a testbench, includes, preprocessor directives, file I/O, system tasks, DPI, delays, initial blocks, or additional modules.","interface":{"top":"counter","ports":[{"name":"clk","direction":"input","width":1},{"name":"rst","direction":"input","width":1},{"name":"count","direction":"output","width":4}]},"constraints":"SystemVerilog; xczu3eg-sbva484-1-e; 5 ns clk; seed 1."},"current":{"revision_id":"963bf08e-d2a6-4945-a671-9f0387672c99","source_sha256":"5cf77fb436fad5a7ce9a1197403cac3a7455fc34512790ac025447bb701fa8c8","source":"module counter (input wire clk, input wire rst, output reg [3:0] count);
